  "bodyHash": "7d76b4b7e82559c7",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 的模組。用心製作。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Difficulty Lock 提供了一種簡單的方式來設定所有（新）世界的難度。對於整合包很有用，或者如果你有一個總是遊玩的預設難度，在單人遊戲中也會很方便。設定檔選項可強制使用極限模式、關閉作弊功能，或禁止選擇創造模式。<br><br>建立世界畫面會正確套用設定檔選項。也支援（獨立）伺服器。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"相依模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/customization-bundle.svg\" alt=\"已包含於 Serilum&#x27;s Customization Bundle\" width=\"416\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><em>優先級顯示當設定檔中多個遊戲模式被設為啟用時，模組會如何處理。例如：若全部啟用，所有新世界都會是和平模式。</em></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>forceHardcoreMode</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用時，將世界遊戲模式強制設為極限模式，並忽略其他難度設定。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>disableCreativeModeSelection</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在世界建立畫面中無法選擇創造模式。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>forcePeaceful</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">優先級 1：啟用時，將任何世界的難度設為和平。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>forceEasy</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">優先級 2：啟用時，將任何世界的難度設為簡單。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>forceNormal</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">優先級 3：啟用時，將任何世界的難度設為普通。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>forceHard</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">優先級 4：啟用時，將任何世界的難度設為困難。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>forceCheatsDisabled</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在初始世界建立畫面中強制停用作弊選項。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>shouldLockDifficulty</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用時，鎖定任何世界的難度，使其無法更改。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>shouldChangeDifficultyWhenAlreadyLocked</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用時，也會將已鎖定難度的世界難度進行設定。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用預設設定時，所有世界的難度都會設為困難且無法更改：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/difficulty-lock/a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"597\"></span></p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">建立世界畫面也會隨之更新。<br>此處設定選項 <strong><em>forceHard</em></strong> 與 <strong><em>forceCheatsDisabled</em></strong> 均設為 <strong><em>true</em></strong>：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/difficulty-lock/b.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">透過設定檔，此模組也可強制玩家以極限模式遊玩：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/difficulty-lock/c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載來源仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，您即可在任何整合包中自由使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於我無法在眾多獨立的模組頁面中追蹤留言，因此已關閉評論功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他需求，請至 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 專案頁面</a> 回報。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
